      "role": "user",
      "content": "wow okay, that's a pretty strong take. but it feels like you're totally dismissing their perspective. aren't there legitimate philosophical reasons why someone might choose to withhold their consent from a system they find fundamentally corrupt? it seems a bit one-sided to just call it cowardice when it's a deeply held conviction for some people.",
